    "A1"
  ],
  "slug": "buy-clothes",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/894_buy-clothes.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Yesterday morning, my younger sister and I went shopping and got home very late. She bought some fruit, and I bought quite a few clothes. I also saw Mr. Wang; he was on his way to a driving lesson. He said my new clothes were very nice, which made me happy."
  ],
  "english_full": "Yesterday morning, my younger sister and I went shopping and got home very late. She bought some fruit, and I bought quite a few clothes. I also saw Mr. Wang; he was on his way to a driving lesson. He said my new clothes were very nice, which made me happy.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Вчера́ у́тром я и моя́ мла́дшая сестра́ пошли́ ку́пить и верну́лись домо́й по́здно. Она купи́ла не́сколько фру́ктов, а я купи́л до́вольно мно́го оде́жды. Я то́же уви́дел г-н Ванга; он был на пути́ к уро́ку вожде́ния. Он ска́зал, что моя́ но́вая оде́жда очень ми́лая, и я ста́л счасли́вым."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Vcherá útrom ya i moyá mládshaya sestrá poshlí kúpit' i vernulís' domóy pózdno. Ona kupíla néskoliko frúktov, a ya kupíl dóvól'no mnógo odézhdy. Ya tózhe uvídel g-n Vanga; on byl na putí k uróku vozhdéniya. On skázal, chto moyá nóvaya odézhda ochen' mílaya, i ya stál schaslívym."
  ],
